===========================================================================================
|ID|OPERATOR                               |NAME                    |EST.ROWS|EST.TIME(us)|
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|0 |VECTOR INDEX ADAPTIVE SCAN (PRE-FILTER)|t_ann_predicate_simplify|1       |3           |
===========================================================================================
Outputs & filters:
-------------------------------------
  0 - output([t_ann_predicate_simplify.id]), filter([t_ann_predicate_simplify.category = 1]), rowset=16
      access([t_ann_predicate_simplify.id], [t_ann_predicate_simplify.category]), partitions(p0)
      is_index_back=true, is_global_index=false, filter_before_indexback[false], 
      range_key([t_ann_predicate_simplify.id]), range(MIN ; MAX)always true
SELECT id
FROM t_ann_predicate_simplify
WHERE category = 1
ORDER BY l2_distance(embedding, [0.1,0.2,0.3]) APPROXIMATE
LIMIT 5;
